// Chandelier (axo-axonic) synapses at the axon initial segment (/biology/axo-axonic/). NEURON results from lab/active/run_aac.py
// embedded below: real CA1 pyramidal cell (mpg141209_A) + Migliore 2005 channels + explicit hillock/AIS/axon + GABA-A Exp2Syn on the AIS.
