// ============================================================================
// Mechanistic giant-fiber circuit (section #gf-mech on /biology/giant-fiber/).
// Every neuron is a ngCable compartmental model: the GF axon (brain → neck connective → thoracic ganglion) with Rebecca's
// 800 MANC axo-axonic input synapses placed along it, and TTMn, PSI and DLMn. GF→TTMn and GF→PSI are mixed synapses
// (ShakB gap junction + nicotinic ACh); PSI→DLMn is cholinergic. Chemical synapses depress with the parameters fitted
